actors. Calculate SE tax, quarterly estimated payments, business deductions, and your expected refund with worked examples.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">self-employed tax refund 2026</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">self-employment tax calculator</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">SE tax 2026</span></div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all\" href=\"/blog/2026-w2-tax-refund-calculator-guide\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/20 dark:text-emerald-400 border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-500/30\">Tax Guide</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">July 4, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">W-2 Employees: 2026 Tax Refund Calculator Guide With Exact Numbers</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">Complete 2026 W-2 tax refund guide for employees. How to read your W-2, calculate federal withholding, apply 2026 brackets, and estimate your refund with worked examples.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">W-2 tax refund calculator 2026</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">W2 refund estimator</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">federal tax refund 2026</span></div></a></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-border/30 glass-strong\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/5 via-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-500/5 border-b border-border/20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"text-center sm:text-left\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\">Stay Updated on <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">Tax Changes</span></h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Get the latest tax tips, calculator updates, and financial insights delivered to your inbox.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full max-w-sm gap-2\"><input type=\"email\" data-slot=\"input\" class=\"file:text-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground dark:bg-input/30 flex h-9 w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-background/50 border-border/30 placeholder:text-muted-foreground\" aria-label=\"Email address for newsletter\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" value=\"\"/><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring